Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.82,0:01:27.87,OP5,main,0,0,0,kara,{\an5\bord12\shad0\blur1.8\be2\fscx103\fscy103\fs104\b1\1c&H0000FF&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&\t(0,120,\fscx108\fscy108)\t(120,240,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(0,140,\alpha&H35&)\t(140,280,\alpha&H00&)\pos(1924,2052)}Sayonara til we meet our show!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till we need a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look who it is and what\Nan ugly face you've got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it's beyond fixing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do, Maki?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you can actually tell\Nwomen apart by their faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you only saw their asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you what you're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So answer me, you piece of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't use sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see cursed spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The looks you had going\Nfor you are ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one is ever going to\Npay attention to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a sad situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.06,0:02:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I bully you like I used to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cling to the shadow of Okotsu or Megumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something, trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.20,0:02:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know very well that we're not\Nallowed entry into the Forbidden Vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, the clan\Nhead gave me permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head of the Zenin clan? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was in Naobito's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:02:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No thanks, it'll just be a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you should accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naobito said he would entrust all\Nof the Zenin clan's assets to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,both the money and the cursed tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you become head of the clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be able to get info on the big\Nthree families and their headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll make a huge difference\Nin what we can do from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you should do it, Maki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, no one's going to\Naccept me as the head of the clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna follow me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact is, you possess\Nthe hereditary technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you can activate your domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you received lots of attention from\NSatoru, but they would barely accept you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I need their acceptance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it even matter what the members\Nof the Zenin clan think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd get all those benefits if\Nyou became the head, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't be me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to\Ncreate a place for Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me why!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me why must you\Nalways be like this, Maki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make me happy I gave birth to you, Maki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have said something if you\Nwere planning this from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jumped the gun like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I agree Megumi Fushiguro\Nwould be better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more than a few\Nvoices pushing for him as
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a chance to repair relations\Nwith the Gojo clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know there's no way\Nwe could accept Fushiguro
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being entrusted with all\Nthe money and cursed tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why were you dilly-dallying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Fushiguro, in addition to\Nthe Gojo clan, has other alliances.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's friendly with Noritoshi,\Nthe next head of the Kamo clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we eliminate him without cause, it\Nwould put the Zenin clan in a worse spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Satoru Gojo sealed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the power balance between clans\Nshifting will fall - I get all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what I don't is why do it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.54,0:05:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't read the notices\Nfrom headquarters yet, have you?
