Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can make use of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Label them as traitors plotting to\Nrelease Satoru Gojo, and then Megumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki, and Mai can be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.28,0:05:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an impressive plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing his own daughters\Nadds believability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, the trust that Headquarters\Nplaces in us will grow firmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And is old man Ogi okay with all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogi came up with this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no cursed tools here, Maki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We emptied our vault in\Nanticipation of your intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
