Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know why they\Nnamed my older brother
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naobito the previous head\Nof the Klan instead of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing because you're an asshole\Nwho would murder his own children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never wondered why I was\Npassed over as head of the clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How it was because my\Ntwo children I know why
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're such hopeless\Nfailures broke his blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You broke my blade and judged\Nthat my reach had been shortened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you closed in on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why you're hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to gauge me by the standards of\Nsuch a failure is absolutely ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say it as many times as I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't chosen to be the previous head\Nof the clan because of the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My older brother's technique\Nwas nothing to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his potential to inherit the\Nclan was never a point of contention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a jujutsu sorcerer, I never lagged\Nbehind my brother in any area except one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The quality of my two children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one rule for children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never drag down your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragging each other down is\Nconsidered a virtue in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This room is used for\Ntraining and punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We keep countless grade two and\Nlower cursed spirits in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're hiding now because\Nthey're afraid of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but soon enough they'll crawl\Nout and begin to devour you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A heavenly pact?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enhanced physical prowess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sorcerers train every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we further strengthen our\Nbodies with cursed energy in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki, your power's ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you possess every single\None of us already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good riddance to the\Nsoul's stain on my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki, you certainly are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always figured it would\Ncome to this one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You basically know at this point\Nwhat my technique can do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I still have trouble creating\Nanything too large or complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wounded from where he cut me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after I create this, I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck on your own\Nafter this. Hey! Mai! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you talking\Nabout just come back here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i've known for a long time now why twins\Nare considered to be such an unfortunate
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,accident by Jujutsu sorcerers you have to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,offer up something in\Norder to gain anything
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this goes beyond just pacts the fact that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we go through pain to\Ngrow stronger follows
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:11:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same logic, but that balance never
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,functions properly in\Nthe case of twins like us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because jujutsu views\Nidentical twins as the same
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,individual do you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.58,0:11:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are me and i am you you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can long to grow stronger\Nand work so hard you spit
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up blood, but it's all pointless\Nbecause I don't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grow stronger at all even if\Nyou don't have any techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's pointless if i have\None so long as i exist maki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will always be incomplete\Nokay i get it just come
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back this is all i'll leave\Nyou with cast off the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take all the cursed energy\Nand everything else with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just promise me one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy everything
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of it, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big sister
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mai, Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mai, wake up, Mai, wake up, Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Mai, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mai, wake up, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cursed spirits were\Nexercised, but my body remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I worked so hard to forget that fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technique release.
