Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blazing courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time I'll burn you down, right to\Nthe marrow of your bones with my own hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, you fail—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mai, let's get started.
