Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it so noisy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki has lost her mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She murdered Ogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Kukuru unit is on it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess even Ogi can be\Ncaught off guard if he's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attacked in his sleep or\Nsitting on the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capture her before I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we dawdle too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinichi will become so smug I'll\Nnever hear the end of it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't kill her yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.13,0:14:14.89,Default,Nobuaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, don't kill her.
