Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.39,0:14:21.98,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}The young men of the Zenin clan who don't possess \Na technique are obligated to join the Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.74,0:14:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The young men of the Zenin clan who don't\Npossess techniques are obligated to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the martial arts are drilled into them
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.98,0:14:26.94,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}The martial arts are drilled into them \Nday and night so they can serve under the Hei.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.06,0:14:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day and night so they\Ncan serve under the hay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.22,0:14:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I plan to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Visual confirmation of two\Nunidentified cursed tools!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki had also been a member\Nuntil she joined Jujutsu High.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.03,0:14:36.70,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}Maki had also been a member until she joined Jujutsu Tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you just stay at the\Nbottom with me, Maki? You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Staying at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that would have\Nbeen the right choice for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.14,0:14:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just promise me one thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please destroy everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of it, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,LALALALA!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's it coming along?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She went for the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Chojuro's technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Hei are here. The Hei. They are\Ncomposed of those whose abilities
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.82,0:18:06.70,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Hei.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.70,0:18:12.79,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}They are composed of sorcerers deemed equivalent \Nto semi-first grade or higher.
