Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.79,0:18:16.38,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}They are the Zenin clan's strongest unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.18,0:18:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Zenin Clan's strongest\Ncollection of sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.98,0:18:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is she so moving after\Ntaking Chojuro's attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.62,0:18:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's pressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easily broke through my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she really the same Maki?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.72,0:19:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep holding her there, Ronda!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't keep holding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about me, Yuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The current Zenin clan only exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the women told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have realized it by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back has become the same as that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear it now!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.08,0:19:35.46,Default,Ranta,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,50)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill her!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.62,0:19:38.25,Default,Ranta,0,0,0,,{\fade(50,0)}Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it, Jinichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were able to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cruel of you.
