Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you no heart left\Ninside of you, Maki?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She took whatever heart I had with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone says I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the head of\Nthe clan after my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard there's a loser in the Zenin clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say the man ain't got a bit\Nof cursed energy in his whole body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be really depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.98,0:21:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I betcha that guy looks\Npretty pathetic too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, four, five, nine, ten, eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't no Toji!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.36,0:21:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sin of the insignificant\Nis the ignorance of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one was able to understand Toji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except maybe City Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you ain't the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one to stand among them!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.63,0:21:49.84,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}Projection Sorcery does not allow movements that \Nexcessively ignore physics and trajectories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Projection sources can't be used to create
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.48,0:21:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,movements that ignore\Nphysics and trajectory.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.84,0:21:54.43,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}Likewise, there's a limit to how much acceleration \Ncan be added upon activation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a limit to how much acceleration
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can be added to one's\Nspeed upon activation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.42,0:21:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The longer the technique\Nis continuously activated,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.43,0:21:59.72,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}However, repeatedly stacking the technique \Nbuilds up one's speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:21:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the further one can raise their speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one to stand among them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.56,0:22:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.46,0:22:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't screw up like I did back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.94,0:22:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Force is wait-time speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wants a Hidden fight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll punch through her at top speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Projection Sorcery is active,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.90,0:22:49.77,Default,Narrator,0,0,328,,{\an8}While Projection Sorcery is active,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.77,0:22:54.57,Default,Narrator,0,0,328,,{\an8}anyone touched by the user's hand must also \Ndefine their actions in steps of 1/24th of a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything the user touches\Nwith their palm must
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,create a movement within\N1 24th of a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.34,0:22:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they fail, they'll be\Nfrozen for one second.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.57,0:22:57.95,Default,Narrator,0,0,328,,{\an8}Failing to do so would freeze them for one second. {If they fail, they're frozen for one second.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was probably planning to take\Nmy attack and stop my movement,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it means I break her ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.70,0:23:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'd fall for such obvious bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are an imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,24 times, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and old man now,\NBeat, aren't just fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.82,0:23:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something off about your speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are creating 24 motions per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can finally see it\Nafter obtaining this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.82,0:24:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.22,0:24:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.10,0:24:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.18,0:24:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.70,0:24:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother, stay away. Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why must you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.76,0:24:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why must you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.98,0:24:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always be like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the way you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.46,0:24:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.70,0:24:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me to come back? huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.26,0:24:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.42,0:24:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.40,0:24:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.30,0:24:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid bitch didn't end me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.30,0:24:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.74,0:25:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.16,0:25:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't focus my cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.76,0:25:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn gutter trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.78,0:25:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I gave birth to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.88,0:25:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.26,0:25:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I told you not to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.14,0:25:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.14,0:25:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do now, Maki?
