Dialogue: 6,0:26:04.89,0:26:10.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.6\shad0\fnGeorgia\fs52\c&H242425&\3c&H959496&\b1\pos(551.4,381)}Several days later,\N both the Gojo clan and Kamo clan\N motioned for headquarters\N to remove the Zenin clan\N from the Three Great Clans.\N Headquarters has tabled this motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.94,0:26:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness descends anew and\Nthe lonely shadow lurks around.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:28.29,0:26:30.64,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}The darkness descends anew
Dialogue: 1,0:26:31.01,0:26:33.81,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}and a lonely shadow lurks around
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for its home in vain,\Nit's praying for redemption.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:33.81,0:26:35.81,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}searching for its home in vain.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:35.81,0:26:37.78,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}It's praying for redemption,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.38,0:26:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As pitiful and wretched as it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:37.81,0:26:41.40,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}as pitiful and wretched as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.04,0:26:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And slowly it begins,\Nseeds of hope bloom again.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:41.40,0:26:47.33,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}And slowly it begins: seeds of hope bloom again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.56,0:26:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are growing colder,\Nyour breath is growing rare.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:47.33,0:26:50.58,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}You are growing colder, your breath is growing rare
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I reach out my hand and\Nit cuts through the air.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:50.77,0:26:54.19,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}I reach out my hand and it cuts through the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.18,0:26:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we just go back to the way we were?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:54.49,0:26:57.91,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}Can't we just go back to the way we were?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.84,0:27:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ever-surging waves rushing in to\Nswallow me When I'm moving forward,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:58.21,0:27:01.63,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}The ever surging waves rushing in to swallow me
Dialogue: 1,0:27:01.93,0:27:05.35,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}When I'm moving forward I destroy all that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.36,0:27:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I destroy all that could be Will\Nthe soothing end ever come for me?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.73,0:27:08.97,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}Will the soothing end ever come for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.64,0:27:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So even if I get stabbed in the heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:11.07,0:27:14.23,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}So even if I get stabbed in the heart
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.22,0:27:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I get torn apart.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:14.41,0:27:16.29,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}or I get torn apart
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.02,0:27:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then scattered around the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.29,0:27:19.11,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}And then scattered around the world
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.96,0:27:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care, cause I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.11,0:27:22.07,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}I don't care, cause I'm not afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.72,0:27:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I'm already empty inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:22.45,0:27:26.74,ED5,,0,0,0,,{\fade(250,0)\blur1\be1\bord1\t(0,1200,\fscx103\fscy103)\t(1200,2400,\fscx100\fscy100)}As I'm already empty inside anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.66,0:27:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, and so when the end has arrived?

